Spider-Man: Far From Home premiered at the TCL Chinese Theatre in Hollywood, Los Angeles, on June 26, 2019, and was
theatrically released in the United States on July 2, as the final film in Phase Three of the MCU.

24
01:46:45,517 --> 01:46:51,517
The film received positive reviews with praise for its humor, action
sequences, visuals, and the performances of Holland and Gyllenhaal.

25
